        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Equestria\n- Products: Hasbro's animated show, its feature film\n- Concepts: Wendigo psychosis\n- Topics: pony tribes, Wendigos\n\nFacts:\n- Equestria is the primary setting for Hasbro's animated show and its feature film.\n- Equestria was founded when the three pony tribes—unicorns, pegasi, and earth ponies—came together in harmony to fight the Wendigos and stop an eternal blizzard.\n- Wendigo psychosis is a controversial modern medical term described by psychiatrists as a culture-bound syndrome involving an intense craving for human flesh and a fear of becoming a cannibal.",
